# Requiem of Sin (battlefield.requiem_of_sin#reqs, Boneyard Gully): Four chars trigger the entry: main (Letter from
# Shikaree Y), bob (Letter from the Mithran Trackers) and dan (both) get event 32000; cat (neither letter) gets
# NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7102 (the framework's trigger refusal) and a release.
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger
char zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem LetterFromShikareeY
bob: keyitem LetterFromTheMithranTrackers
dan: keyitem LetterFromShikareeY
dan: keyitem LetterFromTheMithranTrackers
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
trigger _081
bob: trigger _081
cat: trigger _081
dan: trigger _081
